        <section id="the-role-of-key-organisations-in-the-cyber-security-industry"  class="t-bg-primary1a">
          
            <h2>The role of key organisations in the cyber security industry</h2>
              <p>Cyber security affects us all in some way and it is important that government and the cyber security industry works together to protect individuals, business and all citizens and their well being from the threat of cyber attack. The UK government has taken on a leading role in protecting both the public and private sectors.
Many businesses do not understand the extent of the risk to which they are exposed and don't realise how cyber crime affects them directly not just as part of the overall national economy.</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
