        <ul>
<li>Monitoring network and application performance to identify irregular activities or attempted breaches.</li>
<li>Performing regular audits of systems to ensure that security practices are compliant.</li>
<li>Identifying any threat actors and liaising with the police and cyber crime units where necessary.</li>
<li>Work with IT departments to set up disaster recovery plans and HR teams to educate employees on how to identify suspicious activity.</li>
</ul>

